				<wikidot:authorName>RhettSarlin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>300030</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Basically just a magic item. But there's a certain level of intrigue here, a deeper story to it, and it's well written enough. Plus I've always liked series 1 type of objects. So a +1 from me, but if this had originally been posted to the main wiki I don't know if this would have lasted. There's lots of people here who have issues with DnD type magic items.</p> 
				 	]]>
